We are all moving full steam ahead. Gary Christensen is the mayor of Maldon, Massachusetts, a town of about 60,000. 60,000 diverse residents. Mayor Christensen worked with a disability advocacy organization called Triangle to replace the old symbol all over Maldon. And he is really enthusiastic about it. He wants to have every conceivable spot here in Maldon replaced with this accessible icon project
我们都在全速前进。加里·克里斯滕森是马萨诸塞州莫尔登市的市长，这是一个拥有约6万名居民的小镇。6万名多元化的居民。克里斯滕森市长与一个名为“三角形”的残疾倡导组织合作，在整个莫尔登取代了旧符号。他对此充满热情。他希望让莫尔登的每一个可能的角落都换上这个无障碍图标项目……

15
