the mayor handed the phone over to Jeff Gentry from Triangle. Hi Lauren, how are you? Together, Triangle and the mayor's office have gotten the new logo at the Talbot's Distribution Center in Maldon and at Clark Shoes, which has its U.S. headquarters in Newton mass, not too far away. People with disabilities are no longer accepting separate but equal work, school and life opportunities.
