00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:39.000
They're moving forward towards a richer future. And hopefully the icon creates dialogue around that. And I believe that the accessible icon is creating a more inclusive world, like we're building here in Maldon. When I asked Pro new signage advocates about how they're expanding its use, they would point to local success stories elsewhere.
他们正朝着更富裕的未来前进。希望这个图标能围绕这一点展开对话。我相信无障碍图标正在创造一个更具包容性的世界，就像我们在莫尔登建造的那样。当我询问新标牌的倡导者他们如何扩大其使用范围时，他们会指向其他地方的本地成功案例。

