the icon here, Jeff, Brian, and Sarah. As in, Jeff Gentry of Triangle and and Brian Glenny and Sarah Hendren from the accessible icon project. Realized how many businesses I am getting to use the new icon. Then they made me regional director of North Carolina for the icon project because I am kicking their butts in getting the icon out in the world. Sarah Hendren says she's not interested in what she calls signwashing, or getting the logo changed just to be politically correct.
